title: Air Fryer Tempeh
method: other
source: https://app.samsungfood.com/recipes/1015da2e4d4b121ea93c0637c9300786a950999fbd2
protein: legumes
ingredient_count: 5
---

  Prepare the @tempeh{1%8 ounce package}(sliced into 1/2"-1" cubes) by slicing it into 1/2"-1" cubes.

In a #bowl{}, mix the @avocado oil{1%tablespoon}, @coconut aminos{1%tablespoon}, @toasted sesame oil{1%teaspoon}, @garlic powder{1%teaspoon}, and @sea salt{1/2%teaspoon}.

Add the tempeh cubes to the bowl and coat them evenly with the mixture.

Preheat the #air fryer{}.

Place the coated tempeh cubes in the #air fryer basket{} in a single layer.

Air fry the tempeh at the desired temperature for about ~{15%minutes}, shaking the basket halfway through the cooking time.

Once crispy and golden, remove the tempeh from the air fryer and serve.

> Neutral oil of choice can be substituted for avocado oil.
> Soy sauce can be substituted for coconut aminos.
> Pink salt can be substituted for sea salt, or adjust salt to suit personal preference.